OL,3,GNEWSAFish and eels' deaths linked to
OL,4,Afirewater pollution
OL,5,
OL,6,FChemicals from firewater runoff entered
OL,7,Fa brook and spread downstream where
OL,8,Fdead fish and eels were later found,
OL,9,Fthe Environment Agency (EA) has
OL,10,Fconfirmed.
OL,12,FThe dead fish were discovered in
OL,13,FBrislington Brook, Bristol, shortly
OL,14,Fafter a blaze at a nearby industrial
OL,15,Festate on 1 September.
OL,17,FThe EA did not directly attribute the
OL,18,Fdeath of the wildlife to the fire but
OL,19,Fsaid that sampling had confirmed that
OL,20,F"chemicals from the firewater runoff
OL,21,Fentered the brook and spread
OL,22,Fdownstream".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
